{"3399860": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "JIAN YING JIANG HU", "steam_appid": 3399860, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >——Original Storyline——<br>A tumultuous martial arts world has been constructed, where there are bandits and tyrants who bully men and women, treacherous villains who betray their masters and ancestors, evildoers who plunder and pillage, as well as deep bonds of kinship as strong as blood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >——Smooth Combat——<br>Experience exhilarating side-scrolling battles with rich combat effects and fluid skill animations, recreating the thrill of arcade-style combo moves for the most spectacular combat experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >——Diverse Gameplay——<br>The game offers various PVE and PVP modes. Players can dive into story dungeons to indulge in a feast of combat and narrative, exploring the dark tales of the martial world. Alternatively, they can compete against other warriors in the arena and immerse themselves in the sword-clashing, blade-flashing world of martial arts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >——Gathering of Warriors——<br>Every warrior character in the game possesses a unique set of combat moves, delivering vastly different battle experiences. Unlock more warriors to ensure your journey through the martial world is never a lonely one!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >——Original Storyline——<br>A tumultuous martial arts world has been constructed, where there are bandits and tyrants who bully men and women, treacherous villains who betray their masters and ancestors, evildoers who plunder and pillage, as well as deep bonds of kinship as strong as blood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >——Smooth Combat——<br>Experience exhilarating side-scrolling battles with rich combat effects and fluid skill animations, recreating the thrill of arcade-style combo moves for the most spectacular combat experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >——Diverse Gameplay——<br>The game offers various PVE and PVP modes. Players can dive into story dungeons to indulge in a feast of combat and narrative, exploring the dark tales of the martial world. Alternatively, they can compete against other warriors in the arena and immerse themselves in the sword-clashing, blade-flashing world of martial arts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >——Gathering of Warriors——<br>Every warrior character in the game possesses a unique set of combat moves, delivering vastly different battle experiences. Unlock more warriors to ensure your journey through the martial world is never a lonely one!</p>", "short_description": "The story opens with a family massacre, telling the chaotic Wuxia world under the darkness, you will play a warrior, out of the family door, set foot on the heroic river lake road of chivalrousness, to save the Central plains of the wind and rain.", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399860/ba511a508b6922a6893e4d000f6bedf1d4a93c96/header.jpg?t=1777521347", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399860/ea748dcddbd149879d6a8078fd41b27f14b3090c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1777521347", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399860/ea748dcddbd149879d6a8078fd41b27f14b3090c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1777521347", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-540 | AMD FX-4350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 650, 1 GB | AMD Radeon HD 7870, 2 GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any<br></li><li><strong>Additio